==Vietnamese==

===Etymology===
Having cognates throughout Mon-Khmer (all borrowed ?), akin to {{cog|lbo|-}}
/bɛː/ ("raft"), {{cog|kha|bùr||raft}}, {{cog|mra|-}} /bɛː/ ("raft"), {{cog|cbn|-}} [phɛ̀ɛ] ("raft") and {{cog|lbn|-}} /pheː/ ("raft"). See also {{cog|th|แพ||raft}} and {{cog|zh|簰||bamboo raft}}. The sense of "cohorts" probably developed from the way bamboo stalks are tied together to make a raft.

